(()=>{const variants=[["Archive / Volt", "未来考古", "酸绿拼贴 · 雕塑与玻璃透镜", "岩石、铬金属与酸绿玻璃构成未来考古标本。漂移的磨砂透镜与大字交错，呼应第一张参考的拼贴层次。"], ["Hyperform", "超形态", "镜面银铬 · 字体网格实验", "虹彩银环越过网格和字形，蓝色与琥珀色反光形成深度；文字在雕塑前后穿插，呼应第二张参考。"], ["Metamorph", "蜕变", "纵向雕塑 · 极细衬线字", "细长的液态雕塑与竖向衬线排版交织，十字定位符和小字构成精密的视觉秩序，呼应第三张参考。"], ["Refraction", "折射", "光学玻璃 · 流银与冰蓝", "透明玻璃与流银薄片穿过文字。冷蓝光晕、透镜和细线共同形成光学实验海报。"], ["Unknown Bloom", "未知之花", "虹彩金属 · 深黑酒红", "有机银花从暗处展开，放大的衬线字与环形标注形成展览海报；以轻微旋转和光泽呼吸呈现动态。"]];let active=1,paused=false;const host=document.querySelector('#poster-host'),templates=[...document.querySelectorAll('.study-preview .acid-poster')].map(p=>p.outerHTML);function choose(mode,scroll){active=mode;host.querySelector('.acid-poster')?.acidPoster?.destroy();host.innerHTML=templates[mode-1].replace('acid-mini','').replace('tabindex="-1"','tabindex="0"');new AcidPoster(host.firstElementChild,{paused});const v=variants[mode-1];document.querySelector('#active-number').textContent='A0'+mode+' / '+v[0].toUpperCase();document.querySelector('#active-title').textContent=v[1];document.querySelector('#active-description').textContent=v[3];document.querySelector('#choose-motion').textContent='暂选 A0'+mode+' ↗';document.querySelectorAll('button[data-mode]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(Number(b.dataset.mode)===mode)));if(scroll)document.querySelector('#live-study').scrollIntoView({behavior:matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce)').matches?'instant':'smooth',block:'start'})}document.querySelectorAll('button[data-mode]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>choose(Number(b.dataset.mode),true)));document.querySelector('#pause-motion').addEventListener('click',e=>{paused=!paused;document.querySelectorAll('.acid-poster').forEach(p=>p.acidPoster?.setPaused(paused));e.currentTarget.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(paused));e.currentTarget.textContent=paused?'播放动态 ▷':'暂停动态 Ⅱ'});document.querySelector('#choose-motion').addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelector('#choice-message').textContent='已暂选 A0'+active+' '+variants[active-1][1]+'。请在聊天中确认编号，再替换到正式主页。';try{localStorage.setItem('chao-acid-choice-v3',String(active))}catch{}});})();